@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}
@operatorId = {{createOperator.response.body.id}}

# ── Bootstrap ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Criar o Owner inicial (não exige autenticação — só funciona se ainda não existir nenhum operator)
# @name createOwner
POST {{baseUrl}}/operators/owner
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Carlos Owner",
  "email": "owner@neoparking.com",
  "password": "SenhaForte123!"
}

###

### Login como Owner
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/operators/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@neoparking.com",
  "password": "SenhaForte123!"
}

###

# ── Operators (requer token do Owner/Admin) ─────────────────────

### Criar um novo Operator (o solicitante vem do token)
# @name createOperator
POST {{baseUrl}}/operators
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "João Operador",
  "email": "joao.operador@neoparking.com",
  "password": "OutraSenha123!",
  "role": "Operator"
}

###

### Buscar operator por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/operators/{{operatorId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Promover Operator para Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/operators/{{operatorId}}/promote
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Confirmar promoção
GET {{baseUrl}}/operators/{{operatorId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Rebaixar Admin para Operator novamente
POST {{baseUrl}}/operators/{{operatorId}}/demote
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Desativar operator
POST {{baseUrl}}/operators/{{operatorId}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Confirmar desativação
GET {{baseUrl}}/operators/{{operatorId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Reativar operator
POST {{baseUrl}}/operators/{{operatorId}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

# ── Validações ────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Login com senha errada (deve retornar 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/operators/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@neoparking.com",
  "password": "senhaErrada"
}

###

### Criar operator sem token (deve retornar 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/operators
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sem Token",
  "email": "semtoken@neoparking.com",
  "password": "Teste123!",
  "role": "Operator"
}

###

### Buscar operator inexistente (deve retornar 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/operators/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
